# The screenshots of the README, taken by the app itself:
#
#   cas --script-file docs/tour.cas
#
# and cut to size with ffmpeg, where P is "split[a][b];[a]palettegen=max_colors=64[p];[b][p]paletteuse=dither=none":
#
#   ffmpeg -i shots/tour-closeup.png    -vf "crop=736:736:1372:532,$P" docs/closeup.png
#   ffmpeg -i shots/tour-spaceships.png -vf "crop=736:736:620:252,$P"  docs/spaceships.png
#   ffmpeg -i shots/tour-editor.png     -vf "crop=736:736:600:28,$P"   docs/cases.png
#   ffmpeg -i shots/tour-editor.png     -vf "crop=736:736:600:752,$P"  docs/properties.png
#   ffmpeg -i shots/tour-analysis.png   -vf "crop=792:1440:600:0,$P"   docs/analysis.png
#   ffmpeg -i shots/tour-library.png    -vf "crop=736:1480:600:0,$P"   docs/library.png
#   ffmpeg -i shots/rule-NAME.png -vf "crop=1702:1702:889:49,scale=640:-1:flags=area,$P" docs/rule-NAME.png
#   oxipng -o max --strip safe docs/*.png
wait 25

# A close look: the cells, and the blocks the next step rewrites, whose outline is off until
# asked for. Spaceships are leaving a blob of Single rotation.
key p; wait 2
step 720; wait 3
scroll Grid 4; wait 6
drag Grid -196 38 right; wait 6
shot tour-closeup
fit; wait 4

# The blob evaporates through an open border, and what leaves is caught and identified.
blob; key o; wait 2; key s; wait 3; key k; wait 2
step 40000; wait 150
shot tour-spaceships

# The shape of Conway's glider, which under Single rotation is a diagonal spaceship too,
# chosen with a band and studied on its own.
key s; wait 3; clear; place 3o$o$bo 130 130
key a; wait 2; move Grid 0 0; press left; move Grid 40 40; wait 2; release left; wait 40
shot tour-analysis
click AnalysisClose; wait 3; key k; wait 2; key o; wait 2

# The rule editor, on Critters.
rule critters; blob; step 300; wait 2; key e; wait 8
shot tour-editor
key e; wait 4

# Four rules. The first three have grown from a single cell.
key g; wait 2; key p; wait 2
rule espca-0dca8f; clear; paint 128 128; step 100; wait 3; shot rule-fractal
rule espca-0925bf; clear; paint 128 128; step 225; wait 3; shot rule-disk
click GridSize; wait 4; click GridSize:128; wait 6
rule four-way-gun; clear; paint 64 64; step 170; wait 3; shot rule-gun
rule ship-factory; blob; step 2000; wait 3; shot rule-factory

# The rule library, in a lower window: the three best rules a search of the quarter-turn family
# kept that the library did not have (cas-search --family quarter-turn --limit 400 --keep 5),
# the best of them given a name, tags and a note since, and pinned; and a rule of that search's
# table that was on the grid a moment ago and has no name.
window 1440 740; wait 12
key l; wait 6
rule 0,2,8,3,1,5,6,14,4,9,10,13,12,11,7,15; wait 4
click LibraryKeep; wait 4; type Rotate and half-turn; key Escape; wait 3
click KeptTags; wait 3; type search, spaceships; key Escape; wait 3
clipboard 17 kinds of spaceship. Threes turn by 180°.
click KeptNote; wait 3; key Ctrl+v; wait 3; key Escape; wait 3
rule 0,2,8,5,1,12,6,13,4,9,3,7,10,14,11,15; wait 4
click LibraryKeep; wait 4; type quarter-turn 2; key Escape; wait 3
click KeptTags; wait 3; type search; key Escape; wait 3
clipboard spaceships: 6 kinds of spaceship, 43 periods, the longest 2792
click KeptNote; wait 3; key Ctrl+v; wait 3; key Escape; wait 3
rule 0,2,8,12,1,10,6,11,4,9,5,14,3,7,13,15; wait 4
click LibraryKeep; wait 4; type quarter-turn 3; key Escape; wait 3
click KeptTags; wait 3; type search; key Escape; wait 3
clipboard spaceships: 6 kinds of spaceship, 43 periods, the longest 2716
click KeptNote; wait 3; key Ctrl+v; wait 3; key Escape; wait 3
rule 15,7,11,4,13,8,6,10,14,9,1,12,2,3,5,0; wait 4
rule 0,2,8,3,1,5,6,14,4,9,10,13,12,11,7,15; wait 4
click LibraryPin; wait 4
move Grid 0 0; wait 6
shot tour-library
quit
